  "label": "User projected onto the textual material",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the text 'international boxing day' as the central element that triggers the pun and humor. The text explicitly sets up the wordplay, and the user is expected to interpret the visual elements (boxing gloves, gift box) in relation to this text to understand the joke. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the user is implicitly invited to engage with the text as the anchor point for the entire meme's meaning.",
